  "¶1 (Zohar quote, 153b): printed יובלת; the Zohar reads יובלא (Jubilee). Kept as printed; suggested correction יובלא.",
  "¶2: printed ולא ננמר אז; read ולא נגמר אז (\"was not completed then\"), נ/ג confusion. Kept as printed, translated per the correction.",
  "¶2: printed לתתברר בנסתרות; read לְהִתְבָּרֵר (ת for ה). Kept the printed consonants (לְתִתְבָּרֵר); translated as להתברר, 'to clarify'.",
  "¶2: לא הוצרך ... לעבוד רק ז' שנים is idiomatic 'needed to work only seven years'; rendered 'no need to work more than seven years'.",
  "¶3: וא' בזוה\"ק ברחל פלח שבע שנין עלאין — the printed ברחל is kept; the Zohar's 'supernal (hidden) years' are elsewhere linked to Leah, so ברחל may be a slip for בלאה; not verified against the Zohar text.",
  "¶5: וזמ\"ש / וז\"ש expanded as וְזֶה (מַה) שֶּׁאָמַר — referring to the Zohar's words.",
  "Letters ה' ו' in ¶1 (ה' עלאה, ו\"ה, ו' דכליל) are the letters Heh and Vav of the Name, not the Divine Name; ו' בנים expanded as שִׁשָּׁה בָּנִים."
 ]
